{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684530/extras/5ffd2eeda464c875978eafb03090af7d.avif?t=1765221858\" alt=\"\"data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684530/extras_big/5ffd2eeda464c875978eafb03090af7d.webp?t=1765221858 width=1560 height=222 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DROP THE BALL. UPGRADE YOUR WORLD. WATCH THE CHAOS RAIN DOWN.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PlinkIdle is a retro-inspired game with an idle/incremental spin on a classic ball drop mechanic. It starts with a simple drop, but the world is quickly expanded with upgrades, buffs, new stages, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684530/extras/ed7d881c0dd465239442b9eda8a2c210.poster.avif?t=1765221858\" aria-label=\"Animated image of dropping balls in PlinkIdle\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684530/extras/ed7d881c0dd465239442b9eda8a2c210.webm?t=1765221858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A REIMAGINED GAME OF CHANCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balls bounce through peg boards with the chance of making it into the max bucket. Every coin and ball earned can be spent on growth: boost your drop rate, multiply rewards, and transform each stage with peg upgrades, rare balls, and splitters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare balls multiply coins against everything they touch:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Common:\u00a01x</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncommon (green):\u00a02x</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare (blue):\u00a05x</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic (purple):\u00a010x</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legendary (gold):\u00a0100x</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advance Through Themed Stages</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684530/extras/6621b4fb63d13c67ac1bf72c2cced579.avif?t=1765221858\" alt=\"Level selection menu\" width=1560 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn Achievements and Progress with Prestige</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684530/extras/8790d5fde3cfd0f8438d7fa95ffc6198.avif?t=1765221858\" alt=\"The achievement level progress bar.\" width=1560 height=345 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy Chaos Meets Idle Play</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel Art Aesthetic \u2013 Hand-crafted retro visuals, full of charm and personality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random With Depth \u2013 Pegs, buckets, and balls all upgradeable for endless build variety.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Themed Stages \u2013 Rainy fields, snowy forests, electric night, and more to unlock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buffs that stack for lasting power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare Spawns \u2013 Gold coins and rare balls that multiply for boosted gains.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievement System \u2013 Track your progress and push for 100%.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >White Noise ASMR as balls rain down.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684530/extras/f53d4392b76ce02fec9b9afde919bafd.poster.avif?t=1765221858\" aria-label=\"animated graphic effects of balls in PlinkIdle\" width=768 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684530/extras/f53d4392b76ce02fec9b9afde919bafd.webm?t=1765221858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Sit back, click, and let the chaos begin.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3684530?t=1765221858","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684530/69e0b7378753bb1903556dc978cb28173be8990c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765221858","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684530/589e2b2e661d07bb6954fe0621331e45edea71f8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765221858","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684530/589e2b2e661d07bb6954fe0621331e45edea71f8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765221858","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>PlinkIdle Playtest</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684530/extras/8e85e700e39ffe1b8bb6dcc00292543d.avif?t=1765221858\" width=1560 height=504 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Feature List</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thematic stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Incremental progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\